    {
      "end": 1020.02,
      "start": 990.02,
      "text": "So it is your life, and it is going to happen in a day, and it is going to take a when, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1021.18,
      "start": 1020.02,
      "text": "I'm going to come out now."
    },
    {
      "end": 1021.68,
      "start": 1021.18,
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "end": 1026.18,
      "start": 1021.68,
      "text": "We didn't know anything about this in December."
    },
    {
      "end": 1027.78,
      "start": 1026.18,
      "text": "We were starting to get rumblings."
    },
    {
      "end": 1031.56,
      "start": 1027.78,
      "text": "China said there was some sort of an outbreak on December 31st,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1034.28,
      "start": 1031.56,
      "text": "but Peter,I'm sorry, not Peter Daszak,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1042.06,
      "start": 1034.28,
      "text": "Dr. Baric signs a government deal with Moderna."
    },
    {
      "end": 1044.46,
      "start": 1042.06,
      "text": "I want to I want to read it exactly to you."
    },
    {
      "end": 1049.12,
      "start": 1044.46,
      "text": "This this deal was made,it's confidential,it's a hundred and I don't know,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1050.68,
      "start": 1049.12,
      "text": "I don't know, 58 pages long."
    },
    {
      "end": 1055.08,
      "start": 1051.88,
      "text": "It is, if I skip to page 104,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1060.72,
      "start": 1055.68,
      "text": "they are entering a specific private confidential agreement."
    },
    {
      "end": 1065.68,
      "start": 1061.28,
      "text": "The NIH appears to be transferring technology to Dr. Barrick,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1068.96,
      "start": 1066.08,
      "text": "but what they're making clear is, quote,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1074.28,
      "start": 1069.68,
      "text": "mRNA coronavirus vaccine candidates developed"
    },
    {
      "end": 1079.24,
      "start": 1074.28,
      "text": "and jointly owned by NIAID and Moderna."
    },
    {
      "end": 1084.24,
      "start": 1080.68,
      "text": "Now this is weird because it's two weeks later that we know there's a problem."
    },
    {
      "end": 1088.24,
      "start": 1084.68,
      "text": "They signed that deal two weeks before,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1094.04,
      "start": 1088.24,
      "text": "and they sign it with the doctor who happened to be a partner with the Bat Lady in Wuhan."
    },
    {
      "end": 1096.12,
      "start": 1094.68,
      "text": "Here's where it gets really dark."
    },
    {
      "end": 1102.92,
      "start": 1097.08,
      "text": "These are the same group of people that in the end of January begin to have meetings,"
    },
    {
      "end": 1109.72,
      "start": 1102.92,
      "text": "and they shut down and begin to smear anyone who's looking into the lab leak theory."
    },
    {
      "end": 1113.24,
      "start": 1110.12,
      "text": "They establish that's not true."
    },
    {
      "end": 1114.76,
      "start": 1113.24,
      "text": "Don't even look there."
    },
    {
      "end": 1117.24,
      "start": 1115.24,
      "text": "It appears to be collusion."
    },
    {
      "end": 1122.6,
      "start": 1117.8,
      "text": "I, you know,we've passed this on to several people in Congress and the Senate."
    },
    {
      "end": 1128.04,
      "start": 1122.6,
      "text": "We know Rand Paul is on this and Dr. Fauci has some answers to give."
    },
    {
      "end": 1162.92,
      "start": 1132.92,
      "text": "I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I, I"
    },
